# Copy to .env.local for development, and add the same keys in the Vercel
# project settings for the deployed app. Every one of these is optional: the app
# runs without them, degrading each feature to a deterministic fallback.

# --- AI recommendations (optional) ------------------------------------------
# Entirely optional. Without it the kit builder runs its rule engine, the cart
# panel ranks by co-rental affinity, and the desk brief is rule-written. Setting
# it upgrades all three to Claude without changing any interface.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Database ---------------------------------------------------------------
# On Vercel this is injected automatically by the Neon integration; you only set
# it by hand for local development against a real database. Without it the app
# runs on an in-process copy of the seeded dataset, which is fine locally but
# not on serverless. The schema creates and seeds itself on first use.
DATABASE_URL=

# --- Payments (optional) -----------------------------------------------------
# Razorpay rather than Stripe: the money is in rupees and the method people
# reach for is UPI. Test keys need no KYC and simulate UPI, cards, netbanking
# and wallets. Without these, taking a payment records it against the invoice
# instead of charging anyone.
#   Dashboard, test mode, Account & Settings, API keys.
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
# Dashboard, Webhooks. Set the endpoint to /api/webhooks/razorpay and subscribe
# to payment.captured. Without this the webhook refuses every request, which is
# the safe default.
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
